 "rootCause": "Every 404 is produced by notFound() thrown inside a page (the per-tree catch-all, the detail page, the /unavailable rewrite target). React server rendering does not run error boundaries, so the not-found boundary cannot render on the server; Next.js 16.4.6 then sends its fallback error document (<html id=\"__next_error__\">, no lang, empty body) with the 404 status and renders the not-found view in the browser after hydration. V1 served unmatched URLs through the root /_not-found route, which renders the view as a page; two root layouts have no such route.",
